  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Title and subject note from: Wilbur &amp; Orville Wright, pictorial materials: a documentary guide / Arthur G. Renstrom. Washington: Library of Congress, 1982, p. 57.</subfield>
  </datafield>
